title: NTP/DNS Amplification Participation
id: d9e8cecb-b44f-45d6-ba08-7456d61a5c6f
status: experimental
description: Detects a host generating a high volume of large NTP monlist or DNS ANY responses outbound, indicating participation in a reflection/amplification DDoS or a compromised, abused service.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1498/002/
logsource:
  category: firewall
detection:
  selection:
    src_port:
      - 123
      - 53
    bytes_out|gt: 1000000
    direction: 'outbound'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - src_ip
  - dst_ip
  - dst_port
falsepositives:
  - Busy legitimate NTP/DNS servers
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.impact
  - attack.t1498.002
